OL,4,CClosed pick-your-own farm's giant      
OL,5,Cstrawberry sold                        
OL,6,GA giant fibreglass strawberry that     
OL,7,Gtook pride of place at a pick-your-own 
OL,8,Gfarm has been sold through an online   
OL,9,Gauction for nearly #3,800.             
OL,11,FGrays Farm in Wokingham, Berkshire,    
OL,12,Fwhich has been recognised by           
OL,13,Fgenerations for the 10ft by 8ft (3m by 
OL,14,F2.4m) fruit, was run by the Gray       
OL,15,Ffamily from 1969 and open to the       
OL,16,Fpublic since 1973.                     
OL,18,FRun initially by Donald Gray, the farm 
OL,19,Fhad been looked after by their son     
OL,20,FPeter, his wife Elizabeth and their    
OL,21,Fson Paul, over recent years.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
