OL,4,CStudent housing plan for asylum seeker 
OL,5,Chotel site                             
OL,6,GPlans are being put together to        
OL,7,Gdemolish a hotel used to accommodate   
OL,8,Gasylum seekers and replace it with     
OL,9,Gstudent accommodation.                 
OL,11,FDeveloper Gilltown wants to demolish   
OL,12,Fthe Highfield House Hotel in           
OL,13,FPortswood, Southampton, and build a    
OL,14,Fnew managed student accommodation      
OL,15,Fbuilding of about 260-bedrooms.        
OL,17,FThe proposals follow confirmation that 
OL,18,Fthe Home Office will stop using the    
OL,19,Fhotel to accommodate people seeking    
OL,20,Fasylum.                                
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
