OL,4,CEvri delivery depot behind the scenes  
OL,5,Con Black Friday                        
OL,6,GCourier firm Evri has insisted "trust  
OL,7,Gwill be earned" as it prepares to      
OL,8,Gdeliver millions of parcels over the   
OL,9,GChristmas period.                      
OL,11,FThe under-fire parcel delivery company 
OL,12,Fhas faced criticism in recent years    
OL,13,Ffrom customers, with concerns raised   
OL,14,Fin Parliament about lost parcels.      
OL,16,FAs its operation ramps up for Black    
OL,17,FFriday and the pre-Christmas surge in  
OL,18,Fonline shopping, the BBC has been      
OL,19,Fbehind the scenes at its depot in      
OL,20,FSouthampton.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
