OL,4,CKnow who is taking your rubbish away,  
OL,5,Ccouncil urges                          
OL,6,GPeople who pay for their rubbish to be 
OL,7,Gtaken away must be sure they are       
OL,8,Ggiving it to legal operators and not   
OL,9,Gunscrupulous fly-tippers, a council    
OL,10,Ghas said.                              
OL,12,FCarol, who works for West Berkshire    
OL,13,FCouncil, took BBC Radio Berkshire out  
OL,14,Fon a tour of what her day job entails. 
OL,16,FAccording to the latest government     
OL,17,Ffigures, recorded incidents of fly-    
OL,18,Ftipping across Berkshire's six         
OL,19,Fcouncils increased by about a quarter  
OL,20,Fbetween 2023/24 and 2024/25.           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
